Rust conversation types and transport/persistence interfaces have been adapted
to this application's Python types, three Custom API protocols, and journal.

app/templates/grok_system_prompt.md is the upstream system prompt template.
app/prompts.py renders its feature switches and changes only product identity,
UI surface, tool availability, and factual workspace/account adapters.
app/grok_tools.py, GrokTodo in app/plan.py, and the Skill invocation path are
Python adaptations of the standard Grok Build read/search/edit/bash/todo/skill
contracts and web_fetch overflow at the same revision. Runtime transport,
process ownership, sandboxing, artifact allocation, and the UI are adapted to
this application. Existing web acquisition providers are retained; their
responses replace xAI's native search generation and HTML fetch transport.
